 "response": {
  "text": "Haan 😊 Shaadi ke liye **budget mein saree** leni ho toh main ₹500–₹2,500 range ko target karungi. Abhi online options mein Banarasi/art-silk, organza aur tissue sarees kaafi achhe mil rahe hain. [www.soch.com](https://www.soch.com/in/collections/sarees/sarees-under-3000.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[www.prashantisarees.com](https://www.prashantisarees.com/collections/sarees-under-3000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[www.varnavi.com](https://www.varnavi.com/collections/sarees-under-2999?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### 💕 Meri budget picks\n\n### [Mohey Embellished Art Silk Saree]()\n*₹1,199*\n\n### [Koskii Navy Blue Soft Raw Silk Gold Saree]()\n*₹1,494*\n\n### [Semi Kanchipuram Silk Saree]()\n*₹1,663*\n\n### [Shimmery Mint Green Tissue Saree]()\n*₹1,599*\n\n### [Koskii Mauve Organza Gold Saree]()\n*₹2,394*\n\n### [House of Pataudi Floral Embellished Saree]()\n*₹1,999*\n\n**Agar ₹1,000 ke andar chahiye:**  \n- Banarasi/art-silk saree — wedding mein expensive-looking lagti hai.\n- Kanjivaram-style soft silk — traditional look ke liye.\n- Organza silk-blend — modern, lightweight look.\n\n**₹1,000–₹2,000:** meri favourite range hai. Ismein **raw silk + gold border, tissue, semi-Banarasi ya elegant organza** lo. For example, Prashanti par abhi ₹1,630–₹1,990 ke aas-paas semi-organza/Banarasi options listed hain. [www.soch.com](https://www.soch.com/in/collections/sarees/sarees-under-3000.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[www.prashantisarees.com](https://www.prashantisarees.com/collections/sarees-under-3000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[www.varnavi.com](https://www.varnavi.com/collections/sarees-under-2999?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**₹2,000–₹3,000:** agar shaadi **close relative ki** hai, toh better-quality Banarasi/semi-tussar/organza lena worth it hai. [www.soch.com](https://www.soch.com/in/collections/sarees/sarees-under-3000.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[www.prashantisarees.com](https://www.prashantisarees.com/collections/sarees-under-3000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[www.varnavi.com](https://www.varnavi.com/collections/sarees-under-2999?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n👉 **Meri personal recommendation:** **wine/maroon, bottle green, royal blue, rani pink ya mauve** mein gold zari wali saree lo—budget saree bhi photos mein rich dikhegi.\n\nAgar tum mujhe **budget (₹1000/₹1500/₹2000/₹3000), age aur shaadi mein tumhara relation (bride ki sister/cousin/guest etc.)** bata do, main tumhare liye **5–7 exact sarees** shortlist kar sakti hoon.",
